      "vision_reason": "The picture shows a dark carved horn snuff container in stylized anthropomorphic form, with a small head, arms folded across the chest, and a tapering conical body — a classic South Sotho snuff container form, clearly photographed against a neutral background.",
      "vision_confidence": "HIGH",
